WEBVTT

00:00.547 --> 00:01.528
The world was burning

00:29.464 --> 00:34.985
The lies were loud. We were the joking tabloid

00:35.045 --> 00:35.565
crowd.

00:39.046 --> 00:45.347
We had no shelter. We had no home. Just the open

00:45.387 --> 00:51.369
road and a telephone. But you.

00:54.435 --> 01:00.179
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:00.259 --> 01:03.741
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

01:03.801 --> 01:10.166
storm. You are the iron hand. You are the shield.

01:10.246 --> 01:16.710
The only army that would not yield. This is our

01:16.870 --> 01:20.953
fortress.

01:24.093 --> 01:31.038
This isn't LA. This isn't a dream. This is a

01:31.099 --> 01:37.664
warehouse. This is a scream. We're building our

01:37.704 --> 01:44.289
truth. We're building our sound. Right here on

01:44.309 --> 01:48.972
our hallowed ground. God is you.

01:52.035 --> 01:57.777
You built a fortress. You gave us walls when we

01:57.857 --> 02:01.378
were torn. You built a place to hide from the

02:01.398 --> 02:08.541
storm. You are the iron head. You are the shield.

02:08.741 --> 02:15.723
The only army that would not yield. This is our

02:16.023 --> 02:17.283
fortress.

02:52.590 --> 02:54.332
Our fortress,

02:55.874 --> 02:59.258
our home

02:59.318 --> 03:04.063
We are the fortress

